@startuml

title notification module 分離 設計差分 component 図

top to bottom direction
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<existing>> #F7F9FC
    BorderColor<<existing>> #546E7A
    FontColor<<existing>> #243447
    BackgroundColor<<added>> #EEF9EF
    BorderColor<<added>> #2E7D32
    FontColor<<added>> #1B5E20
    BackgroundColor<<removed>> #FFF1F1
    BorderColor<<removed>> #C62828
    FontColor<<removed>> #7F1D1D
    BackgroundColor<<changed>> #FFF8E1
    BorderColor<<changed>> #F9A825
    FontColor<<changed>> #4E342E
    BackgroundColor<<risk>> #F4F7FA
    BorderColor<<risk>> #607D8B
    FontColor<<risk>> #1F2933
}

package "変更しない同期応答主経路" as SyncLayer {
    class "Controller\nWails Bind request / response" as Controller <<existing>>
    class "Backend UseCase\napplication result を返す" as BackendUseCase <<changed>>
    class "TranslationJobPolicy\n状態判断の正本" as TranslationJobPolicy <<existing>>
    class "JobIOService\n状態事実の取得 / 保存" as JobIOService <<existing>>
    class "Service\n実処理と状態事実の確定" as Service <<changed>>
}

package "追加予定の notification module" as NotificationLayer {
    class "NotificationSinkPort\n実行側の横接続入口" as NotificationSinkPort <<added>>
    class "NotificationDispatcher\n通知種別 / redaction / 送信可否" as NotificationDispatcher <<added>>
    class "NotificationPort\ntransport 送信境界" as NotificationPort <<added>>
    class "RuntimeAdapter\nWails runtime event 実送信" as RuntimeAdapter <<existing>>
    class "将来の Runner / Worker\n同じ通知入口を使う" as FutureRunner <<added>>
}

package "削除予定の直結依存" as LegacyLayer {
    class "RuntimeEventPublisherPort\nUseCase から runtime へ近い旧 port" as RuntimeEventPublisherPort <<removed>>
    class "Controller 経由の途中経過通知" as ControllerNotificationRelay <<removed>>
}

package "変更しない接続先" as UnchangedLayer {
    class "synchronous response\nController caller へ返す" as SyncResponse <<existing>>
    class "Wails runtime event\ntransport boundary" as WailsRuntimeEvent <<existing>>
}

Controller -[#546E7A]-> BackendUseCase : 変更しない
BackendUseCase -[#546E7A]-> TranslationJobPolicy : 変更しない
BackendUseCase -[#546E7A]-> JobIOService : 変更しない
BackendUseCase -[#546E7A]-> Service : 変更しない
Controller -[#546E7A,dotted]-> SyncResponse : 変更しない
RuntimeAdapter -[#546E7A,dotted]-> WailsRuntimeEvent : 変更しない

BackendUseCase -[#2E7D32]-> NotificationSinkPort : 追加予定
Service -[#2E7D32]-> NotificationSinkPort : 追加予定
FutureRunner -[#2E7D32]-> NotificationSinkPort : 追加予定
NotificationSinkPort -[#2E7D32]-> NotificationDispatcher : 追加予定
NotificationDispatcher -[#2E7D32]-> NotificationPort : 追加予定
NotificationPort -[#2E7D32]-> RuntimeAdapter : 追加予定

BackendUseCase -[#C62828,dashed]-> RuntimeEventPublisherPort : 削除予定
BackendUseCase -[#C62828,dashed]-> RuntimeAdapter : 削除予定
Controller -[#C62828,dashed]-> ControllerNotificationRelay : 削除予定
ControllerNotificationRelay -[#C62828,dashed]-> RuntimeAdapter : 削除予定

note right of NotificationDispatcher
通知 module が担う範囲:
- 通知種別
- redaction
- 送信可否
- 送信失敗の扱い
end note

note right of TranslationJobPolicy
変更しない判断:
- 状態遷移可否
- terminal guard
- provider response validation
end note

legend bottom right
    |= Style |= 意味 |
    |<#FFF1F1> removed | 削除予定 |
    |<#EEF9EF> added | 追加予定 |
    |<#FFF8E1> changed | 依存先または責務が変わる要素 |
    |<#F7F9FC> existing | 変更しない接続先 |
endlegend

@enduml
